      "text52867b778586": "One kortix.yaml.",
      "textd0dfd435b2f4": "Your AI workforce, as code.",
      "text6dc0b331852f": "Agents, skills, tools, connectors and schedules are files in a repo. Edit them in your IDE, ship them with one command.",
      "text1cd4ee467781": "For humans",
      "text04acce351310": "For agents",
      "text9f5c9fa004f0": "Install the Kortix CLI with `curl -fsSL https://kortix.com/install | bash`, then run `kortix system-skills` to learn how to drive Kortix.",
      "text69423babe8e6": "File contents",
      "text2efb4a036449": "Agents are sandboxes.",
      "textb7bdfef0884d": "Every agent runs in its own disposable cloud VM, on its own git branch. Spin up thousands in parallel. Nothing is shared between runs.",
      "textd0402b9e5b2b": "Sandbox boots",
      "textff23daa7d8a9": "runtime + your repo",
      "text38eb8696624d": "Agent works",
      "textfb7efc268d20": "on branch session/1f3a",
      "text3e87aa005e38": "you review the diff",
      "text653516645c01": "Merged to main",
      "textda0aeb0ae5ee": "sandbox thrown away",
      "textf03edab2b5cf": "Work is code.",
      "text48ab3bffe3da": "You own the stack.",
      "textea64448cda1c": "kortix cloud",
      "textdb80902e511f": "your servers",
      "textcb3d2cb4cb30": "Write it like code. Run it like a fleet.",
      "text3d560e7ee7e8": "Agents live in your repo as files. Kortix runs each session in its own sandbox.",
      "textbeb2f69dc6cc": "One line to start.",
      "text9df55ba340b6": "kortix init adds kortix.yaml, agents/ and skills/ to your repo.",
      "text8c1ec6ce30ee": "Agents are markdown.",
      "textb435b593a2f2": "A persona, a model and its tools in one file you can review.",
      "textcbc2c5b5eca1": "Ship with one command.",
      "text3b3501befe21": "kortix ship pushes, builds the sandbox and asks for missing secrets.",
      "textcaf949597949": "A sandbox per session.",
      "text7b6c2c52f4a2": "Every session runs in its own cloud VM, on its own branch.",
      "textab5f0e1b73aa": "Every change is a diff.",
      "text4bd70f847bb3": "Agents work on branches. You review and merge.",
      "text76de92907d9a": "Your model. Your choice.",
      "text49bec9429eef": "Pick the model per agent, or bring your own coding agent.",
      "text647561206575": "1 session = 1 sandbox = 1 branch.",
      "texta85e9114fa21": "Every session runs in its own isolated sandbox on its own branch off main. Run them in parallel; nothing is shared.",
      "text818bb0b1e9d0": "Branch graph",
      "textc8d244a0ee9d": "review → merge → main",
      "text9b572a8a2dfc": "triage 14 tickets",
