      "text7094632abbd6": "Questions, answered.",
      "text16b672d86284": "Which models can I use?",
      "text671f35507c5d": "Bring your own keys: Anthropic, OpenAI or local models. Or run on Kortix compute. Add your keys with kortix providers.",
      "text9a80eb70d6b4": "Can I self-host Kortix?",
      "textb393e2a90943": "Yes. Run the exact same stack on a laptop, a VPS or your own VPC with kortix self-host.",
      "text25ef8b079eed": "Where do my tool credentials live?",
      "textc6bea3767895": "Connector credentials stay server-side and never reach the sandbox. Agents reach connectors through one scoped Kortix token.",
      "textd4586396b9ba": "Can agents use the CLI themselves?",
      "text9e52157faaab": "Yes. The same Kortix CLI runs inside every sandbox, pre-authenticated, so agents use the exact commands you do.",
      "text48b78a9ab65b": "How do runs stay isolated?",
      "text4af0b7d8bfb1": "Every session runs in its own sandbox on its own git branch. Nothing is shared between runs.",
